# Who must review what. This file can only ask for a review; whether a review is *required* is a branch-protection
# setting (Settings → Branches → Require review from Code Owners), which only the repository owner can turn on.
#
# PLACEHOLDER: replace @xsitraxs below with the account or team that should own the build and the server, if it is
# not the owner of the repository. A CODEOWNERS entry naming a user who cannot be found is silently ignored, so this
# has to be a real handle for the protection to mean anything.
*       @xsitraxs

# The pieces where a mistake costs the most: what gets signed and shipped, and what the server trusts.
/.github/               @xsitraxs
/scripts/               @xsitraxs
/build*                 @xsitraxs
/server/                @xsitraxs
/SECURITY.md            @xsitraxs
